;; shinogi 鎬 — exam-competition INVOLUTION driver seed.
;;
;; Concrete policies / institutions / practices / norms that INTENSIFY or RELIEVE
;; the high-stakes examination involution (内卷) and the FAILURE cycle. Each row
;; records the driver, WHO established/sustains it (:enactor — institutional /
;; public bodies, NOT private individuals, G6), the CIRCUMSTANCES (:origin / 経緯),
;; and the related parties (:stakeholders / 関係者).
;;
;; :polarity/:magnitude/:confidence are shinogi's DISCLOSED HYPOTHESES (G5), not
;; proven causation; the policy/year/enactor/origin are on-the-record public facts
;; (:sourcing :representative). This is a relief/leverage MAP — NEVER a student
;; shame-list, school ranking, or country ranking-to-shame (G7 + G8 sober framing).
;; The failure cycle is routed toward RELIEF (kokoro/shiori), never amplified.
;;
;; magnitude ∈ 0..1 (estimated contribution to the stock) · confidence ∈ 0..1
;; meadows ∈ 1..12 (deeper = lower number) · China-primary; the set is comparative
;; (KR/JP/IN/FI/DE siblings) and grows each /loop. polarity :intensify worsens the
;; spiral, :relieve eases it, :ambiguous is contested.
[
