  :note "Could be a relieving alternative pathway if de-stigmatized (cf. de-dual-vocational)."}

 {:type :driver :id "cn-one-child-legacy" :name "一人っ子政策 legacy (concentrated investment)" :jurisdiction "CN" :kind :policy :year 1979
  :enactor "State Council one-child policy (1979–2015); demographic legacy persists post-repeal"
  :origin "Decades of single-child households concentrated family hope, savings, and expectation onto one child (the 4-2-1 grandparents-parents-child pyramid). That concentration raises the perceived stakes of the exam and the household resources poured into it."
